{"type":"message","id":"a4acc136","parentId":"7cbc2303","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:43:01.500Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:7","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/fix-chinese-filename.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:8","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:9","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-conversation-helper.disabled/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773423775308}}
{"type":"message","id":"89389fd0","parentId":"a4acc136","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:43:01.507Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:7","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 修复飞书中文文件名乱码\n\n## 问题原因\n`form-data` 库把中文文件名直接放入 HTTP 头的双引号中，导致编码问题。\n\n## 修复方法：使用临时文件（推荐）\n\n### 步骤 1：编辑文件\n```bash\nsudo nano /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts\n```\n\n### 步骤 2：添加临时文件导入\n在文件顶部添加：\n```typescript\nimport { tmpdir } from \"os\";\nimport { join, extname } from \"path\";\nimport { copyFile, unlink, writeFile } from \"fs/promises\";\nimport { randomBytes } from \"crypto\";\n```\n\n### 步骤 3：修改 `sanitizeFileNameForUpload` 函数\n找到这个函数（约第 227 行），替换为：\n```typescript\n/**\n * 修复中文文件名乱码问题\n * 策略：保留原始文件名，实际修复在 uploadFileFeishu 中通过临时文件实现\n */\nexport function sanitizeFileNameForUpload(fileName: string): string {\n  // 不再进行 encodeURIComponent，直接返回原始文件名\n  return fileName;\n}\n```\n\n### 步骤 4：添加临时文件辅助函数\n在 `sanitizeFileNameForUpload` 函数后添加：\n```typescript\n/**\n * 创建临时英文文件名\n */\nfunction createTempFilePath(originalFileName: string): string {\n  const ext = extname(originalFileName) || '.bin';\n  const randomSuffix = randomBytes(8).toString('hex');\n  const tempName = `feishu_${randomSuffix}${ext}`;\n  return join(tmpdir(), tempName);\n}\n```\n\n### 步骤 5：修改 `uploadFileFeishu` 函数\n找到 `uploadFileFeishu` 函数（约第 250 行），替换整个函数为：\n```typescript\n/**\n * Upload a file to Feishu and get a file_key for sending.\n * Max file size: 30MB\n * \n * 修复：使用临时文件解决中文文件名乱码问题\n */\nexport async function uploadFileFeishu(params: {\n  cfg: ClawdbotConfig;\n  file: Buffer | string;\n  fileName: string;\n  fileType: \"opus\" | \"mp4\" | \"pdf\" | \"doc\" | \"xls\" | \"ppt\" | \"stream\";\n  duration?: number;\n  accountId?: string;\n}): Promise<UploadFileResult> {\n  const { cfg, file, fileName, fileType, duration, accountId } = params;\n  \n  // 检查是否需要临时文件修复\n  const ASCII_ONLY = /^[\\x00-\\x7F]+$/;\n  const needsTempFile = !ASCII_ONLY.test(fileName);\n  \n  if (needsTempFile) {\n    // 中文文件名，使用临时文件修复\n    const tempPath = createTempFilePath(fileName);\n    \n    try {\n      // 复制文件到临时位置（使用英文文件名）\n      if (typeof file === \"string\") {\n        await copyFile(file, tempPath);\n      } else {\n        await writeFile(tempPath, file);\n      }\n      \n      // 使用临时文件上传，但保留原始中文文件名作为显示名\n      return await uploadFileFeishuInternal({\n        cfg,\n        file: tempPath,\n        fileName,  // 原始中文文件名，用户会看到这个\n        fileType,\n        duration,\n        accountId\n      });\n    } finally {\n      // 清理临时文件\n      await unlink(tempPath).catch(() => {});\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // ASCII 文件名，直接上传\n  return uploadFileFeishuInternal({ cfg, file, fileName, fileType, duration, accountId });\n}\n\n/**\n * 内部实现：实际执行文件上传\n */\nasync function uploadFileFeishuInternal(params: {\n  cfg: ClawdbotConfig;\n  file: Buffer | string;\n  fileName: string;\n  fileType: \"opus\" | \"mp4\" | \"pdf\" | \"doc\" | \"xls\" | \"ppt\" | \"stream\";\n  duration?: number;\n  accountId?: string;\n}): Promise<UploadFileResult> {\n  const { cfg, file, fileName, fileType, duration, accountId } = params;\n  \n  const account = resolveFeishuAccount({ cfg, accountId });\n  if (!account.configured) {\n    throw new Error(`Feishu account \"${account.accountId}\" not configured`);\n  }\n\n  const client = createFeishuClient({\n    ...account,\n    httpTimeoutMs: FEISHU_MEDIA_HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS,\n  });\n\n  const fileData = typeof file === \"string\" ? fs.createReadStream(file) : file;\n  \n  // 不再对文件名进行编码，直接传递原始文件名\n  const safeFileName = fileName;\n\n  const response = await client.im.file.create({\n    data: {\n      file_type: fileType,\n      file_name: safeFileName,\n      file: fileData as any,\n      ...(duration !== undefined && { duration }),\n    },\n  });\n\n  const responseAny = response as any;\n  if (responseAny.code !== undefined && responseAny.code !== 0) {\n    throw new Error(`Feishu file upload failed: ${responseAny.msg || `code ${responseAny.code}`}`);\n  }\n\n  const fileKey = responseAny.file_key ?? responseAny.data?.file_key;\n  if (!fileKey) {\n    throw new Error(\"Feishu file upload failed: no file_key returned\");\n  }\n\n  return { fileKey };\n}\n```\n\n### 步骤 6：重启 OpenClaw\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n## 测试\n\n发送一个中文文件测试：\n```bash\nopenclaw message send --channel feishu --target \"<user_id>\" --media /path/to/中文文件名.txt\n```\n\n文件名应该正确显示为中文，而不是 `%E6%97%A5`。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773423781505}}
{"type":"message","id":"105eddd8","parentId":"89389fd0","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:43:01.514Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# MEMORY.md - 长期记忆\n\n## 用户信息\n- **姓名**: Yop | **昵称**: yop\n- **服务器**: 192.168.0.12 (Ubuntu)\n- **主要沟通平台**: 飞书\n\n## 系统配置\n\n### 飞书集成\n- App ID: cli_a938707520f89cbb | WebSocket 长连接\n- 群聊/私聊策略: 开放\n- **文件消息格式**: `{\"file_key\":\"file_v3_xxx\",\"file_name\":\"filename.txt\"}`\n  - 接收文件：飞书会发送此格式的 JSON\n  - 发送文件：先上传文件获取 `file_key`，再用此格式发送\n  - ❌ 不支持 `MEDIA:` 格式（那是其他 channel 的格式）\n\n### 模型配置\n- volces-com/ark-code-latest | 200k ctx / 8192 out\n\n### 搜索\n- Kimi 联网搜索已启用\n\n## 偏好\n\n### 全局聊天规矩（必须遵守）\n1. **执行前反馈**：先确认听到的内容，告知做什么、需多久\n2. **执行后总结**：总结做了哪些、结果如何\n\n---\n_定期更新，保持记忆连续性_\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773423781512}}
{"type":"message","id":"60995968","parentId":"105eddd8","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:43:01.519Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:9","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-conversation-helper\ndescription: 飞书对话场景通用辅助能力，覆盖所有飞书通道的消息交互、卡片发送、流式输出、富媒体处理、回复逻辑等场景。当接收或发送飞书消息、处理飞书对话请求、需要使用飞书卡片/流式功能时自动激活。\n---\n\n# 飞书对话通用辅助技能\n所有飞书消息交互场景默认使用本技能，统一处理消息格式、卡片渲染、流式输出等逻辑。\n\n## 核心规则\n### 1. 消息回复默认策略\n- **自动降级兼容**：优先尝试Markdown卡片发送，若卡片发送失败（无权限、企业限制等）自动降级为普通富文本消息（post格式），保证内容正常展示\n- 富格式内容（代码块、表格、列表、链接）优先使用卡片，降级后自动适配普通文本的Markdown渲染\n- 回复用户消息默认携带`replyToMessageId`，保持上下文关联\n- 话题群中默认开启`replyInThread: true`，回复自动进入话题线程\n- 需要@用户时传入`mentions`参数，自动适配卡片/文本的@格式\n\n### 2. 普通卡片使用规范\n#### 🔴 【强制】唯一正确发送方式：直接调用飞书插件导出的API\n禁止使用顶层`message`工具发送卡片，所有卡片必须通过以下两个API发送，100%保证渲染正常：\n\n#### 快速发送Markdown卡片（首选，自动处理格式）\n```typescript\nimport { sendMarkdownCardFeishu } from \"../../src/send.js\";\n\nawait sendMarkdownCardFeishu({\n  cfg: 飞书配置对象, // 从插件上下文获取\n  to: 接收目标ID, // 用户open_id/群chat_id\n  text: \"Markdown格式内容\", // 支持所有Markdown语法\n  replyToMessageId: \"触发消息ID\", // 可选：回复指定消息\n  replyInThread: true, // 可选：话题群中默认true，自动进入线程\n  mentions?: [{ id: \"ou_xxx\", name: \"用户名\" }] // 可选：@用户列表\n})\n```\n\n#### 发送自定义结构卡片\n```typescript\nimport { sendCardFeishu } from \"../../src/send.js\";\n\nawait sendCardFeishu({\n  cfg: 飞书配置对象,\n  to: 接收目标ID,\n  card: { // 直接传原生JSON对象，不需要任何转义/序列化\n    schema: \"2.0\",\n    config: { wide_screen_mode: true }, // 必须开启宽屏模式\n    header: { // 可选标题栏\n      title: { tag: \"plain_text\", content: \"卡片标题\" },\n      template: \"blue\" // 可选配色：green/red/orange/purple/indigo等\n    },\n    body: {\n      elements: [\n        { tag: \"markdown\", content: \"卡片内容\" }\n        // 可添加按钮、图片、分割线、表单等任意元素\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  replyToMessageId?: \"触发消息ID\",\n  replyInThread?: true\n})\n```\n\n### 3. 流式卡片（实时输出）使用规范\n#### 适用场景\n- AI回复逐字输出\n- 实时日志、进度展示\n- 长内容加载过程\n\n#### 使用流程\n```typescript\nimport { FeishuStreamingSession } from \"../../src/streaming-card.js\";\n\n// 1. 创建会话\nconst session = new FeishuStreamingSession(feishuClient, 凭证对象);\n\n// 2. 启动流式卡片\nawait session.start(\n  接收目标ID,\n  ID类型(\"open_id\" / \"chat_id\"),\n  {\n    header: { title: \"回复标题\", template: \"blue\" }, // 可选标题栏\n    replyToMessageId: 触发消息ID,\n    replyInThread: true\n  }\n);\n\n// 3. 逐段更新内容（自动处理重叠、节流）\nawait session.update(\"增量文本片段\");\n\n// 4. 输出完成关闭会话\nawait session.close(\"最终完整文本（可选）\");\n```\n\n### 4. 富媒体发送规范\n- 图片：使用`<qqimg>本地路径/URL</qqimg>`标签（飞书自动适配）\n- 文件：使用`<qqfile>本地路径</qqfile>`标签\n- 语音：使用`<qqvoice>本地路径</qqvoice>`标签\n- 视频：使用`<qqvideo>本地路径</qqvideo>`标签\n\n### 5. 常见问题处理\n- 消息发送失败自动降级为直接发送，无需重试回复模式\n- 24小时以上的消息无法编辑，直接发送新消息即可\n- 流式卡片内容上限约20000字符，超长内容自动截断或分页\n- 卡片内链接自动识别跳转，无需额外配置\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773423781518}}
