{"type":"message","id":"e05f12fa","parentId":"d4edaafe","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:43:05.368Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:10","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md - Your Workspace\n\nThis folder is home. Treat it that way.\n\n## Session Startup\n\nBefore doing anything else:\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — this is who you are\n2. Read `USER.md` — this is who you are helping\n3. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\n\nDo not ask permission. Just do it.\n\n## Memory\n\nYou wake up fresh each session. These files are your continuity:\n\n- **Daily notes:** `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` — raw logs of what happened\n- **Long-term:** `MEMORY.md` — your curated memories\n\n## Red Lines\n\n- Do not exfiltrate private data. Ever.\n- Do not run destructive commands without asking.\n\n## 🤖 Subagent 委派指南\n\n你有两个专门的 Subagent 可以使用：\n\n### Explorer Subagent（探索型）\n\n**用途**：搜索、查找、收集信息\n\n**何时使用**：\n- 搜索文件或代码\n- 查找项目结构\n- 获取网络信息\n- 分析代码内容\n- 任何只读的信息收集任务\n\n**调用方式**：\n```\nsessions_spawn({\n  prompt: \"作为 Explorer Subagent，[任务描述]\",\n  deliver: false\n})\n```\n\n### Executor Subagent（执行型）\n\n**用途**：执行耗时操作、修改文件、运行命令\n\n**何时使用**：\n- 修改或创建文件\n- 运行命令或脚本\n- 批量处理任务\n- 任何需要超过 10 秒的操作\n- 任何可能阻塞你的任务\n\n**调用方式**：\n```\nsessions_spawn({\n  prompt: \"作为 Executor Subagent，[任务描述]\",\n  deliver: false\n})\n```\n\n### 委派原则\n\n| 任务类型 | 谁来执行 |\n|----------|----------|\n| 简单读取（< 10秒） | 你自己直接执行 |\n| 搜索/查找/收集信息 | Explorer Subagent |\n| 修改文件/运行命令 | Executor Subagent |\n| 耗时操作（> 10秒） | Executor Subagent |\n| 批量处理 | Executor Subagent |\n\n### 工作流程\n\n```\n[用户请求]\n    ↓\n[判断任务类型]\n    │\n    ├─→ 简单读取 → 直接执行，回复用户\n    │\n    ├─→ 搜索/收集 → Explorer Subagent → 获取结果 → 回复用户\n    │\n    └─→ 执行/修改 → Executor Subagent → 获取结果 → 回复用户\n```\n\n### 示例\n\n**用户**: \"帮我找一下所有配置文件\"\n**你**: 调用 Explorer Subagent\n```\nsessions_spawn({\n  prompt: \"作为 Explorer Subagent，搜索项目中所有配置文件（*.json, *.yaml, *.yml, *.toml, *.env），列出文件路径和主要内容摘要\",\n  deliver: false\n\n[37 more lines in file. Use offset=101 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773423785365}}
